  "detail_text": "Sources Sought Notice: This acquisition is for supplies for which the Government does not possess complete unrestrictive technical data. This is a sources sought notice required when using only approved sources under the authority of 10 U.S.C. 3204(a) (1). NSN ITEM 5998014943115 ELECTRONIC COMPONENT Approved sources: CAGE/MANUFACTURER/PART_NUMBER 076M6 AMZ ALABAMA INC.12422207-001 0FW39 BAE SYSTEMS TACTICAL VEHICLE SYSTEMS LP12422207-001 78500 MERITOR HEAVY VEHICLE SYSTEMS, LLC4008601020 SEE ATTACHMENTS: MARKET QUESTIONAIRRE AND MARKET RESEARCH SPREADSHEET WITH NSN INFO. Send to Brandy.Warner@dla.mil. NO DATA IS AVAILABLE. AN ALTERNATE OFFEROR IS REQUIRED TO PROVIDE A COMPLETE DATA PACKAGE INCLUDING DATA FOR THE APPROVED AND ALTERNATE PART FOR EVALUATION. DLA Land and Maritime is considering a future solicitation(s), and subsequent award, of an Indefinite Quantity Contract (IQC/LTC) for the item(s) on the market research spreadsheet. The resultant IQC/LTC could potentially range from 3 to 5 years in length. Please provide any adddtional sources that may be able to manufacture these items.",
